  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w09.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "第九戦のあと、あの規定は、もう立っていられなかった。書き直された挑戦状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "満員の賭け札。場内が見てしまった、台本に無い死闘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——理由は、三つもあれば十分だった。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "週明けの受付で、儀式をした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "規定集の当該の巻を開き、「台本試合規定」の条文に——赤いインクで、まっすぐ一本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の手で引いた。事務員の線引きは、狂わない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが、受付の掲示板に正式の紙を貼った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「当該規定、運用停止のお知らせ」貼り終えて、彼女は小さく拍手をした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「規定が正しく死ぬところ、初めて見ました」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……正式が、いちばん強いんだなあ。耳が、ちょっと得意げに立った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街は、その赤線一本を、さっそく祭りの口実にした。折よく、海の花火大会の週だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「赤線記念!」と屋台が勝手に銘打ち、意味の分からない祝祭の熱が浜へ流れ込んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街の祝い方は、いつも理屈が後から来る。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "浜は、去年と同じで、去年と違った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人魚の花火は今年も海の中で開き、音のない花火は今年も音を想像させた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "花火師の口上だけ、一言増えていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年は一輪多いよ! めでたい理由が、ひとつ多いんでね!」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人混みの向こうに、狼の目の人がいた。焼きとうもろこしを片手に、空を見上げている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初めて「結果を知らない九戦目」を終えた人の顔は、祭りの灯りの下でずいぶん若く見えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "目が合って、互いに、小さく会釈だけした。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——浜の端に、無粋な一角があった。三脚と、収録機材と、白い手袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "再演企画室が、花火を録っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの歓声も、花火師の口上も、機材は等しく吸い込んでいく。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "係員の手元の台帳が、ちらりと見えた。「素材: 祝祭(使用予定: 新企画)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……新企画。祭りまで素材にする会社の、次の企画とは何だろう。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大玉が上がる。歓声の中で、懐の規定集の写しに触れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤線、一本。残り、五本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w09.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——祭りの夜に数える線の本数は、悪くない酔い方をする。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w09.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
